 "result": "```python\nimport math\nimport cadquery as cq\n\n# Plate parameters\nL = 60.0\nW = 60.0\nT = 6.0\ncenter_hole_d = 22.0\nbolt_hole_d = 3.2\nbolt_circle_d = 50.8\n\nr = bolt_circle_d / 2.0\npts = [\n    (r * math.cos(math.radians(a)), r * math.sin(math.radians(a)))\n    for a in (45, 135, 225, 315)\n]\n\nplate = (\n    cq.Workplane(\"XY\")\n    .box(L, W, T)\n    .faces(\">Z\").workplane()\n    .hole(center_hole_d)\n    .faces(\">Z\").workplane()\n    .pushPoints(pts)\n    .hole(bolt_hole_d)\n)\n\ncq.exporters.export(plate, \"out.step\")\n```",
